```json
{"summary": "In this room, looking from the entrance, the sleek black coffee table made with tempered glass that is minimalist and modern is centered on top of the neutral beige area rug made with wool that is plush and geometric. Positioned 0.5 meters to the left of the coffee table is the brushed brass floor lamp made with linen that is tall and slender. In the corner adjacent to the floor lamp is the first vibrant green potted plant made with ceramic that is lush and leafy, while the second identical potted plant is positioned symmetrically opposite the first. The third potted plant is placed near the entrance next to the light oak bookshelf made with engineered wood that is open and airy, which is against the wall between two framed abstract wall arts made with canvas that are bold and colorful—the first hung 1.5 meters above the bookshelf and the second mounted symmetrically opposite the first. A mustard yellow throw pillow made with velvet that is soft and textured is casually draped over the edge of the coffee table, while another is placed on the floor beside the first potted plant. The remaining two throw pillows are stacked on top of each other, resting against the base of the floor lamp."}
```

