```json
{"speech": "A compact sunroom with a contemporary design awaits, featuring plush flooring and vintage-inspired walls. Centered on a neutral beige wool rug is a sleek black tempered glass coffee table, minimalist and modern. To its left stands a tall, slender brushed brass floor lamp with a linen shade. Two vibrant green ceramic potted plants, lush and leafy, are symmetrically placed in the corners, with a third near the entrance next to a light oak engineered wood bookshelf, open and airy. Bold and colorful abstract canvas art frames flank the bookshelf, hung 1.5 meters above. Mustard yellow velvet throw pillows add soft texture—one draped over the coffee table, another by the first plant, and two stacked at the lamp's base. A sleek white frameless tempered glass door connects this serene space to the outdoors."}
```

